  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="880545a9-033a-5ec4-b721-fc3562ca7d37" activityNameId="17bbd9d0-4698-55af-8dc6-9226f6fbd348" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Copper, Sxx EW, at refinery</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Copper, Sxx EW, at refinery
The product "copper, SX-EW, at refinery" is used in the production mix represented in module "copper, primary, at refinery" of the respective region.;
CAS number: 007440-50-8; 
UUID: 97298974-f913-3d9b-a269-0c843a2554d3
The module includes the mining of the ore including the mining infrastructure, the leaching and extraction, the electro winning an the disposal of the leaching residues.
Location: This module is valid for an average world-wide process.
Technology: Heap leaching was assumed as average process. The ore is mined in open cut technique, leached and extracted with sulphuric acid and reduced by electro winning. For electricity mix a mix of 60% hydropower and 40% electricity at grid UCTE was chosen.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: 870 thousand tonnes in Cu in 1994
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_97298974-f913-3d9b-a269-0c843a2554d3.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="f4808887-5a57-5892-975e-ba0565a93e23" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
